+# TLS Certificate Verification
+
+TLS certificate verification is required on all builds, including development builds, with no exemption: an earlier decision to disable certificate verification in development builds as a convenience workaround has been reverted, so TLS/HTTPS connections must validate certificates consistently across development, staging, and production environments.
